<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="BrainzOS is an institutional operating system harmonizing student learning, faculty academic operations, and executive leadership for CBSE senior secondary schools." />
  <meta name="author" content="Brainz Academic Computing Cluster" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#1C232B" />

  <!-- Open Graph & Social Card Metadata -->
  <!-- PRODUCTION NOTE: In production, og:image and twitter:image must point to an absolute HTTPS 1200x630px institutional social banner asset. -->
  <meta property="og:title" content="BrainzOS — Institutional Operating System" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Unified academic and administrative computing cluster for senior secondary education." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://brainzos.edu/assets/preview-social-card.png" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="BrainzOS" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="BrainzOS — Institutional Operating System" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Unified academic and administrative computing cluster for senior secondary education." />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://brainzos.edu/assets/preview-social-card.png" />

  <!-- Lightweight Inline SVG Favicon (No external requests, zero bloat) -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='8' fill='%231C232B'/%3E%3Ctext x='50%25' y='54%25' dominant-baseline='middle' text-anchor='middle' fill='%23D4C9B7' font-family='serif' font-size='18' font-weight='bold'%3EB%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E" />

  <!-- =========================================================================
       PRODUCTION ARCHITECTURE NOTE: robots.txt & sitemap.xml
       In a standalone single-file demo, robots.txt and sitemap.xml cannot be served
       because they require root-level web server routing (/robots.txt and /sitemap.xml).
       In production:
       1. /robots.txt prevents web spiders from indexing authenticated or sensitive directories:
          User-agent: *
          Disallow: /admin/
          Disallow: /director/
          Disallow: /api/
          Disallow: /audit/
          Allow: /login
          Sitemap: https://brainzos.edu/sitemap.xml
       2. /sitemap.xml publishes crawlable public endpoints (landing, institutional prospectus,
          public statutory disclosures, governance bylaws) while strictly excluding student records.
       ========================================================================= -->

  <!-- =========================================================================
       PRODUCTION ARCHITECTURE NOTE: Analytics Installation (TODO)
       DO NOT inject live tracking scripts into this demo file.
       In production, integrate a privacy-first, GDPR/DPDP-compliant telemetry engine
       (e.g., self-hosted Plausible Analytics or PostHog) with:
       - Explicit user consent gate (cookie/tracking policy opt-in)
       - Strict Content Security Policy (CSP) headers without unsafe-inline
       - Anonymized IP masking and zero student PII collection
       ========================================================================= -->

  <!-- =========================================================================
       CHECKLIST B: SECURITY HYGIENE & PRODUCTION READINESS SPECIFICATION
       The majority of items below represent server, database, and infrastructure
       controls that are out of scope for a standalone client-side demo file.
       However, when BrainzOS is coupled to a live backend (Node/Go/Python/Postgres),
       the following 20 security controls must be systematically enforced.

       *** CRITICAL FIRST PRIORITIES FOR PRODUCTION TRANSITION ***
       1. AUTH SESSIONS (Item 17) -> 2. INPUT VALIDATION (Item 9) -> 3. ADMIN ROUTE LOCKING (Item 5)

       ITEMIZED PRODUCTION HYGIENE MATRIX:
       1. Enable RLS (Row-Level Security):
          Supabase/PostgreSQL policies enforcing multi-tenant isolation. E.g.:
          CREATE POLICY "students_view_own" ON student_grades FOR SELECT USING (auth.uid() = student_id);
          CREATE POLICY "teachers_manage_cohort" ON attendance FOR ALL USING (auth.role() = 'faculty');
       2. Hide API Keys:
          All LLM keys, cloud credentials, and service role tokens must remain strictly
          in server environment variables (BFF pattern). Never bundle API keys into client JS.
       3. Test IDOR (Insecure Direct Object References):
          Backend endpoints must verify identity ownership on every resource parameter:
          e.g., GET /api/v1/students/:id/pass must assert req.user.id === params.id || req.user.isStaff.
       4. Scan for Git Secrets:
          Run pre-commit hooks (TruffleHog, Gitleaks) and GitHub Secret Scanning in CI/CD
          pipelines to prevent committing certificates, passwords, or tokens.
       5. Lock Admin Routes:
          CLIENT: Hardened in this demo via navigateTo() role guard blocking Director/Teacher
                  pages from student sessions or direct URL hash tampering.
          SERVER: Edge middleware & backend JWT claim verification (e.g., role === 'director')
                  returning 403 Forbidden on any unauthorized endpoint invocation.
       6. Test User Isolation:
          Automated regression suites testing cross-tenant, cross-cohort, and cross-role leakage.
       7. Rate Limit APIs:
          Nginx / Cloudflare / Redis token-bucket rate limiters on auth routes (max 5 failed
          logins / 15 mins) and write APIs to thwart brute-force and DDoS attacks.
       8. Lock Storage Buckets:
          AWS S3 / GCP Cloud Storage buckets configured as private (no public read).
          Issue short-lived pre-signed upload/download URLs (TTL < 15 mins) for coursework.
       9. Validate All Inputs:
          CLIENT: Implemented in this file via escapeHtml(), regex email checks, and min-length guards.
          SERVER: Schema validation (Zod, Joi, or Pydantic) on all request bodies, rejecting unknown keys.
       10. Block Unauthenticated Routes:
           CLIENT: Implemented in this file via navigateTo() unauthenticated guard redirecting to login.
           SERVER: Strict 401 Unauthorized responses for any unauthenticated requests to protected endpoints.
       11. SQL Injection:
           Parameterized queries and ORM prepared statements (Prisma, Drizzle, SQLAlchemy); zero raw string SQL.
       12. Sensitive Logs:
           Redact PII, biometric tokens, passwords, and authorization headers from logging sinks (Datadog/CloudWatch).
       13. Field Tampering:
           Server-side schema controls ensuring client cannot tamper with read-only fields (e.g., student GPA, role).
       14. Upload Restrictions:
           Validate magic bytes (MIME inspection), limit file size to 25MB, and run asynchronous ClamAV virus scans.
       15. Authoritative Server-Side Logic:
           All grade calculations, attendance counts, and venture approvals computed on backend microservices.
       16. Trimming API Responses:
           API response serializers must never return full database models, password hashes, or internal IDs.
       17. Auth Sessions:
           HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict cookies with rotating refresh tokens and server-side Redis invalidation.
       18. Dependency Scanning:
           Automated Dependabot and npm audit / Snyk scans integrated into CI/CD pipelines to block CVEs.
       19. Record Access Auditing:
           Immutable, append-only cryptographic audit ledger tracking all administrative mutations.
       20. Penetration Testing ("Attack Your Own App"):
           Scheduled DAST/SAST vulnerability scanners, OWASP ZAP runs, and third-party ethical penetration testing.
       ========================================================================= -->

  <title>BrainzOS — Institutional Operating System | CBSE Senior Secondary Cluster</title>

  <!-- Typography: Newsreader (Editorial Serif) & Plus Jakarta Sans (Precision UI) -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />

  <!-- Lucide Icon Font Runtime -->
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>

  <style>

    /* =========================================================================
       1. DESIGN SYSTEM TOKENS
       ========================================================================= */
    :root {
      /* Required Brand Colors */
      --color-blue: #6A8EAE;        /* Primary interactive & focus */
      --color-beige: #D4C9B7;       /* Secondary highlights & warm borders */
      --color-cream: #F8F4ED;       /* Main application background */
      --color-sage: #9EBBAF;        /* Positive / live status indicator */

      /* Supporting Refined Institutional Palette */
      --color-ink: #1C232B;         /* Deep academic slate for primary text */
      --color-ink-muted: #5C6773;   /* Secondary muted slate */
      --color-ink-subtle: #8C97A4;  /* Tertiary subtle slate */
      --color-surface-white: #FFFFFF;
      --color-surface-cream: #FAF7F2;
      --color-border: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.16);
      --color-border-subtle: rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.08);
      --color-border-warm: rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.45);
      
      /* Glassmorphic Surfaces (used intentionally and sparingly) */
      --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      --glass-bg-subtle: rgba(248, 244, 237, 0.72);
      --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
      --glass-blur: blur(16px);
      
      /* Typography */
      --font-heading: "Newsreader", "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", "URW Palladio L", P052, Georgia, serif;
      --font-body: "Plus Jakarta Sans", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      
      /* Type Scale */
      --text-xs: 0.75rem;    /* 12px */
      --text-sm: 0.844rem;   /* 13.5px */
      --text-base: 0.938rem; /* 15px */
      --text-md: 1.063rem;   /* 17px */
      --text-lg: 1.25rem;    /* 20px */
      --text-xl: 1.5rem;     /* 24px */
      --text-2xl: 1.875rem;  /* 30px */
      --text-3xl: 2.375rem;  /* 38px */
      --text-4xl: 3.125rem;  /* 50px */

      /* Elevations & Radii */
      --radius-sm: 8px;
      --radius-md: 14px;
      --radius-lg: 18px;
      --radius-xl: 24px;
      --radius-full: 9999px;

      --shadow-subtle: 0 1px 3px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.04), 0 4px 12px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.02);
      --shadow-raised: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.06), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.03);
      --shadow-floating: 0 16px 48px -8px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.12), 0 4px 12px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.04);

      /* Motion & Physics */
      --ease-spring: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      --ease-smooth: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      --duration-quick: 180ms;
      --duration-normal: 260ms;

      /* Layout Dimensions */
      --sidebar-width: 264px;
      --sidebar-collapsed-width: 76px;
      --topbar-height: 68px;
    
      /* Dynamic Attendance & Evaluation Status Colors */
      --color-offwhite: #F8F4ED;
      --font-display: "Newsreader", "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, serif;
      --font-ui: "Plus Jakarta Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      --color-status-amber: #B87B2E;
      --color-status-amber-bg: rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.35);
      --color-status-amber-border: rgba(184, 123, 46, 0.32);
      --color-status-red: #A84232;
      --color-status-red-bg: rgba(168, 66, 50, 0.12);
      --color-status-red-border: rgba(168, 66, 50, 0.28);
}

    /* =========================================================================
       2. BASE RESET & NORMALIZATION
       ========================================================================= */
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html, body {
      min-height: 100%;
      background-color: var(--color-cream);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* Subtle architectural paper texture gradient with atmospheric depth */
    body {
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 12% 0%, rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.22) 0%, transparent 48%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 100%, rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.18) 0%, transparent 52%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 15%, rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.15) 0%, transparent 42%);
      background-attachment: fixed;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Fixed Atmospheric Background Orbs (Depth without clutter or contrast loss) */
    .ambient-orbs {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .ambient-orb-blue {
      position: absolute;
      top: -140px;
      right: -100px;
      width: 780px;
      height: 780px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12) 0%, rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.03) 50%, transparent 70%);
      filter: blur(95px);
      -webkit-filter: blur(95px);
      will-change: transform;
    }
    .ambient-orb-sage {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -150px;
      left: 6%;
      width: 820px;
      height: 820px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.14) 0%, rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.03) 52%, transparent 70%);
      filter: blur(100px);
      -webkit-filter: blur(100px);
      will-change: transform;
    }
    .ambient-orb-warm {
      position: absolute;
      top: 38%;
      right: 30%;
      width: 540px;
      height: 540px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.12) 0%, rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.02) 55%, transparent 70%);
      filter: blur(85px);
      -webkit-filter: blur(85px);
      will-change: transform;
    }

    button, input, select, textarea {
      font: inherit;
      color: inherit;
    }

    button {
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      background: none;
      outline: none;
    }

    input {
      outline: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* Accessible focus state */
    :focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--color-blue);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       3. REFINED TYPOGRAPHIC SCALE
       ========================================================================= */
    h1, h2, h3, h4, .font-heading {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.022em;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    h1 { font-size: var(--text-3xl); font-weight: 600; }
    h2 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); font-weight: 500; }
    h3 { font-size: var(--text-xl); font-weight: 500; }
    h4 { font-size: var(--text-lg); font-weight: 500; }

    p {
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    }

    .subtext {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       4. ELEVATION CARDS & UTILITY CLASSES
       ========================================================================= */
    .card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 26px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.05), 0 1px 3px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.02);
      transition: transform 240ms var(--ease-spring),
                  box-shadow 240ms var(--ease-spring),
                  border-color 200ms ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px -4px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.08), 0 3px 10px -2px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.05);
      border-color: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.25);
    }

    .card-flat {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
    }

    .card-elevated {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
    }

    /* Systemic Page Headers (Teacher, Director & Shared) */
    .page-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .page-header-text {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 260px;
    }
    .page-header-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      line-height: 1.15;
    }
    .page-header-desc {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      margin-top: 6px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .page-header-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* Table Container Utility (overflow-x safe for mobile) */
    .table-container {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      transition: box-shadow 200ms ease;
    }

    .table-container table {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 560px;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .table-container th {
      padding: 14px 18px;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      background: rgba(248, 244, 237, 0.65);
    }

    .table-container td {
      padding: 14px 18px;
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      transition: background-color 150ms ease;
    }

    .table-container tr:hover td {
      background-color: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.035);
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .badge-blue {
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.14);
      color: #3f607c;
      border: 1px solid rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.28);
    }

    .badge-sage {
      background: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.22);
      color: #436959;
      border: 1px solid rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.4);
    }

    .badge-beige {
      background: rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.28);
      color: #695e4d;
      border: 1px solid rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.5);
    }

    /* Interactive Status Pills (Attendance & Dynamic Tables) */
    .status-pill-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }
    .status-pill-btn:hover {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }
    .status-pill-btn:active {
      transform: scale(0.96);
    }
    .status-pill-present {
      background: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.22);
      color: #315846;
      border-color: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.45);
    }
    .status-pill-late {
      background: var(--color-status-amber-bg);
      color: var(--color-status-amber);
      border-color: var(--color-status-amber-border);
    }
    .status-pill-absent {
      background: var(--color-status-red-bg);
      color: var(--color-status-red);
      border-color: var(--color-status-red-border);
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       5. LOGIN EXPERIENCE & ROLE DETECTOR
       ========================================================================= */
    .login-viewport {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 32px 20px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      transition: opacity var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring),
                  transform var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .login-viewport.hidden-view {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .login-card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 470px;
      padding: 44px 38px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
      position: relative;
    }

    .login-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 10%;
      right: 10%;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--color-beige), transparent);
    }

    .brand-mark {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .brand-crest {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--color-ink);
      color: var(--color-cream);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.35);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.12);
    }

    .brand-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .brand-tagline {
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .login-heading {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .login-description {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      margin-bottom: 26px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .form-label {
      display: block;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .input-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .input-wrapper .input-icon {
      position: absolute;
      left: 16px;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      pointer-events: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .input-wrapper input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px 16px 14px 46px;
      background: rgba(248, 244, 237, 0.65);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      font-size: var(--text-base);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .input-wrapper input:focus {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.15);
    }

    /* Live Detected Role Indicator Pill */
    .role-detection-box {
      margin: 14px 0 22px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: rgba(248, 244, 237, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 42px;
      transition: all var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .role-detection-box.detected {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .detection-label {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    .detection-result {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      opacity: 0.8;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .detection-result.active {
      color: var(--color-ink);
      opacity: 1;
      animation: roleEntrance 300ms var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .role-dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      transition: background-color var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }

    .detection-result.student .role-dot { background: var(--color-blue); }
    .detection-result.teacher .role-dot { background: var(--color-sage); }
    .detection-result.director .role-dot { background: #8E7C68; }

    @keyframes roleEntrance {
      0% { transform: scale(0.92); opacity: 0; }
      100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
    }

    /* Universal Buttons & Tasteful Micro-interactions */
    button,
    .btn-primary,
    .btn-secondary,
    .btn-sm-primary,
    .demo-role-btn,
    .icon-btn-subtle,
    .asg-filter-btn,
    .quick-action-card,
    .tab-btn {
      transition: transform 150ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
                  box-shadow 180ms ease,
                  background-color 180ms ease,
                  color 180ms ease,
                  border-color 180ms ease;
    }

    button:active:not(:disabled),
    .btn-primary:active:not(:disabled),
    .btn-secondary:active:not(:disabled),
    .demo-role-btn:active,
    .icon-btn-subtle:active,
    .asg-filter-btn:active,
    .tab-btn:active {
      transform: scale(0.975);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      background: var(--color-blue);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: var(--text-base);
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.32);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: #5A7E9E;
      transform: translateY(-1.5px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.40);
    }

    .btn-primary:active:not(:disabled) {
      transform: scale(0.98) translateY(0);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.25);
    }

    .btn-primary:disabled {
      opacity: 0.6;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      box-shadow: none;
      transform: none !important;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 9px;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-color: var(--color-beige);
      transform: translateY(-1.5px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.06);
    }

    .btn-secondary:active {
      transform: scale(0.98) translateY(0);
    }

    .auth-footer {
      margin-top: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       6. APP SHELL LAYOUT & PINNED SIDEBAR
       ========================================================================= */
    .app-viewport {
      display: none;
      min-height: 100vh;
      position: relative;
    }

    .app-viewport.active-view {
      display: block;
      animation: shellFadeIn 320ms var(--ease-spring);
    }

    @keyframes shellFadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* Left Sidebar: Pinned flush, full height flex column */
    .app-sidebar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      height: 100vh;
      width: var(--sidebar-width);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow: hidden;
      z-index: 50;
      transition: width var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring),
                  transform var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .sidebar-header {
      height: var(--topbar-height);
      padding: 0 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .sidebar-brand {
      height: var(--topbar-height);
      padding: 0 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .sidebar-crest {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--color-ink);
      color: var(--color-cream);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .sidebar-brand-text {
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .sidebar-brand-text strong,
    .sidebar-brand-text h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .sidebar-brand-text small,
    .sidebar-brand-text span {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    /* Navigation items container: fills remaining height & scrolls cleanly */
    .sidebar-nav-items,
    .sidebar-nav {
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      padding: 16px 12px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .nav-category {
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      padding: 12px 12px 6px;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 500;
      text-align: left;
      position: relative;
      transition: color 200ms ease,
                  background-color 220ms ease,
                  box-shadow 220ms ease,
                  transform 140ms ease;
    }

    .nav-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.08);
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .nav-btn.active {
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.13);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-weight: 600;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.18), 0 2px 8px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.06);
    }

    /* Smooth animated indicator bar when switching pages instead of snapping */
    .nav-btn::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 8px;
      bottom: 8px;
      width: 3.5px;
      background: var(--color-blue);
      border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
      transform: scaleY(0);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: transform 260ms cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1),
                  opacity 200ms ease;
    }

    .nav-btn.active::before {
      transform: scaleY(1);
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .nav-btn svg {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      stroke-width: 1.8px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      color: inherit;
      transition: transform 180ms ease;
    }
    .nav-btn:hover svg {
      transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    /* Pinned Bottom User Footer: Flush to bottom, single cohesive tight row */
    .sidebar-footer {
      margin-top: auto;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      background: rgba(250, 247, 242, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }

    .user-card-sm,
    .user-profile-card {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }

    .user-card-sm:hover,
    .user-profile-card:hover {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
      border-color: var(--color-border);
    }

    /* Avatar circle with subtle depth */
    .user-avatar {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-blue), #50718e);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.28);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    }

    .user-meta,
    .user-info {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .user-meta h4,
    .user-name {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .user-role-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-blue);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .icon-btn-subtle,
    .user-logout-btn {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .icon-btn-subtle:hover,
    .user-logout-btn:hover {
      color: #c94b4b;
      background: rgba(201, 75, 75, 0.1);
      transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    /* Main Content Wrapper */
    .app-main, .workspace-area {
      margin-left: var(--sidebar-width);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: margin-left var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    /* Topbar Header */
    .app-topbar, .app-header {
      height: var(--topbar-height);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 40;
      background: rgba(248, 244, 237, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 32px;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .topbar-left, .header-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 580px;
    }

    .mobile-menu-btn, .mobile-toggle-btn {
      display: none;
      padding: 8px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      min-width: 44px;
      min-height: 44px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* Global Search with ⌘K Trigger */
    .global-search-container, .search-trigger {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .global-search-container:hover, .search-trigger:hover {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.16);
    }

    .global-search-input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 48px 10px 38px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      box-shadow: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .global-search-icon {
      position: absolute;
      left: 14px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      pointer-events: none;
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .search-placeholder {
      margin-left: 8px;
      flex: 1;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .global-search-kbd, .shortcut-keys {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2px;
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      background: var(--color-cream);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-left: auto;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .kbd {
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    /* Topbar Right Items */
    .topbar-right, .header-right {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    /* Sage Live Status Beacon */
    .system-status-pill, .connection-status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .status-beacon, .status-indicator {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--color-sage);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .status-pulse {
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--color-sage);
      opacity: 0.7;
      animation: sagePulse 2.4s cubic-bezier(0.24, 0, 0.38, 1) infinite;
    }

    @keyframes sagePulse {
      0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.7; }
      50% { transform: scale(2.4); opacity: 0; }
      100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0; }
    }

    /* Topbar User Profile */
    .topbar-user, .user-profile-menu {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding-left: 8px;
    }

    .user-avatar-top {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--color-ink);
      color: var(--color-cream);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .topbar-user-meta, .user-profile-info {
      text-align: right;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .topbar-user-name, .topbar-name {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      display: block;
    }

    .topbar-user-role, .topbar-subtext {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      display: block;
    }

    .header-logout-btn {
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      padding: 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
      min-width: 36px;
      min-height: 36px;
    }

    .header-logout-btn:hover {
      color: #c94b4b;
      background: rgba(201, 75, 75, 0.08);
    }

    /* Form Validation & Inline Error States (Checklist A12 & B9) */
    .form-field-error {
      color: var(--color-status-red);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-top: 5px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
      animation: fieldErrorIn 180ms var(--ease-spring);
    }
    @keyframes fieldErrorIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .input-error, input.has-error, textarea.has-error, select.has-error {
      border-color: var(--color-status-red) !important;
      background-color: rgba(168, 66, 50, 0.04) !important;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(168, 66, 50, 0.12) !important;
    }

    /* Form Success Confirmation Banners (Checklist A13) */
    .form-success-banner {
      background: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.22);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-sage);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 12px 16px;
      color: #1F3F34;
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      animation: bannerSlideIn 240ms var(--ease-spring);
    }
    @keyframes bannerSlideIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* Sticky Mobile CTA on Small Screens (Checklist A10) */
    .login-sticky-cta {
      display: contents;
    }

    /* Async Data-Loading Skeleton & Spinner State (Checklist A11) */
    .async-route-loader {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(248, 244, 237, 0.82);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 45;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 180ms var(--ease-smooth);
    }
    .async-route-loader.active {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
    .loader-content {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      background: var(--color-surface-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
      max-width: 90%;
    }
    .academic-spinner {
      width: 26px;
      height: 26px;
      border: 3px solid rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.2);
      border-top-color: var(--color-blue);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: spinSpinner 0.7s linear infinite;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    @keyframes spinSpinner {
      to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }
    .loader-text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
    }
    .loader-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }
    .loader-subtitle {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    /* In-App 404 / Unknown Route View (Checklist A1) */
    .notfound-card {
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: var(--color-surface-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 48px 36px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
    }
    .notfound-icon-wrap {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--color-status-amber-bg);
      color: var(--color-status-amber);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    /* Cookie / Institutional Session Banner (Glass-card Bottom-Right Toast) */
    .cookie-banner {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 24px;
      right: 28px;
      left: auto;
      transform: translateY(0);
      width: calc(100% - 56px);
      max-width: 450px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px -8px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.14), 0 0 0 1px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.16);
      z-index: 999;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      line-height: 1.45;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      transition: opacity 280ms var(--ease-spring), transform 280ms var(--ease-spring);
    }
    .cookie-banner.dismissed {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cookie-content {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .cookie-content i,
    .cookie-content svg {
      width: 30px !important;
      height: 30px !important;
      padding: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12);
      color: var(--color-blue) !important;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .cookie-content div {
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    }
    .cookie-content strong {
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .cookie-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .btn-sm-primary {
      background: var(--color-blue);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.3);
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }
    .btn-sm-primary:hover {
      background: #5A7E9E;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
    .btn-sm-primary:active {
      transform: scale(0.96);
    }

    /* Institutional Footer Legal / Support Affordance (Checklist A14, A17) */
    .auth-footer a.footer-link, .app-footer-link {
      color: var(--color-blue);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: color var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }
    .auth-footer a.footer-link:hover, .app-footer-link:hover {
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    /* Content Canvas Area */
    .content-canvas {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 36px 40px;
      max-width: 1540px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Page View Containers */
    .os-page {
      display: none;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(6px);
      transition: opacity var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring),
                  transform var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .os-page.active {
      display: block;
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
      animation: pageTransitionIn 260ms var(--ease-spring);
    }

    @keyframes pageTransitionIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* Placeholder Welcome View */
    .placeholder-container {
      border: 1px dashed var(--color-beige);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 60px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .placeholder-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       7. COMMAND LAUNCHER MODAL (⌘K / Ctrl+K)
       ========================================================================= */
    .cmd-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.45);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      z-index: 100;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 12vh 20px 20px;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-smooth);
    }

    .cmd-overlay.active {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .cmd-palette {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 580px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
      overflow: hidden;
      transform: translateY(-8px) scale(0.98);
      transition: transform var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .cmd-overlay.active .cmd-palette {
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    }

    .cmd-search-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .cmd-search-input {
      flex: 1;
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      font-size: var(--text-base);
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .cmd-search-input:focus {
      outline: none;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .cmd-kbd-badge {
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      padding: 3px 6px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      background: var(--color-cream);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    .cmd-results {
      max-height: 340px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 10px;
    }

    .cmd-group-title {
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      padding: 8px 12px 4px;
    }

    .cmd-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 11px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }

    .cmd-item-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .cmd-item svg {
      width: 17px;
      height: 17px;
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    }

    .cmd-item:hover, .cmd-item.selected {
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12);
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .cmd-item:hover svg, .cmd-item.selected svg {
      color: var(--color-blue);
    }

    .cmd-empty {
      padding: 36px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
    }

    .cmd-footer {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      background: var(--color-cream);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    .cmd-hints {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       8. BIOMETRIC AUTHENTICATION SIMULATION MODAL
       ========================================================================= */
    .biometric-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      z-index: 120;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-smooth);
    }

    .biometric-overlay.active {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .biometric-modal {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 380px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 38px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
      transform: scale(0.94);
      transition: transform var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .biometric-overlay.active .biometric-modal {
      transform: scale(1);
    }

    .bio-sensor-ring {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.08);
      border: 2px solid var(--color-blue);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .bio-laser-beam {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: var(--color-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--color-blue);
      animation: laserSweep 1.2s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes laserSweep {
      0% { top: 10%; opacity: 0.3; }
      100% { top: 90%; opacity: 1; }
    }

    .bio-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      color: var(--color-blue);
      stroke-width: 1.5;
    }

    .bio-success-icon {
      display: none;
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      color: var(--color-sage);
    }

    .bio-status-title {
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .bio-status-desc {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       9. RESPONSIVE MEDIA QUERIES
       ========================================================================= */
    /* Tablet Breakpoint (1024px and below) */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      :root {
        --sidebar-width: var(--sidebar-collapsed-width);
      }

      .sidebar-brand-text,
      .nav-category,
      .nav-btn span,
      .user-info,
      .user-meta,
      .user-logout-btn,
      .icon-btn-subtle {
        display: none !important;
      }

      .sidebar-header {
        padding: 0 18px;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .nav-btn {
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 12px;
      }

      .nav-btn.active::before {
        left: 2px;
      }

      .user-card-sm,
      .user-profile-card {
        padding: 6px;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .content-canvas {
        padding: 28px 24px;
      }
    }

    /* Mobile Breakpoint (768px and below) */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .app-sidebar {
        transform: translateX(-100%);
        width: 270px;
      }

      .app-sidebar.mobile-open {
        transform: translateX(0);
        box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }

      .sidebar-brand-text,
      .nav-category,
      .nav-btn span,
      .user-info,
      .user-logout-btn {
        display: block;
      }

      .user-meta {
        display: flex !important;
      }
      .icon-btn-subtle {
        display: flex !important;
      }

      .nav-btn {
        justify-content: flex-start;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        min-height: 44px;
      }

      .app-main, .workspace-area {
        margin-left: 0;
      }

      .mobile-menu-btn, .mobile-toggle-btn {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .app-topbar, .app-header {
        padding: 0 16px;
      }

      .topbar-user-meta, .user-profile-info {
        display: none;
      }

      .content-canvas {
        padding: 20px 14px;
      }

      .login-card {
        padding: 32px 20px;
      }

      .system-status-pill, .connection-status {
        display: none; /* preserve space on smaller viewports */
      }

      .table-container {
        border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      }
    }

    /* Compact Mobile Breakpoint (540px and below) */
    @media (max-width: 540px) {
      /* Sticky Mobile CTA on login screen (Checklist A10) */
      .login-sticky-cta {
        display: block;
        position: sticky;
        bottom: 12px;
        z-index: 50;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        padding: 8px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.14);
        margin-top: 14px;
      }

      .login-sticky-cta button {
        margin: 0 !important;
        width: 100% !important;
      }

      .cookie-banner {
        right: 14px;
        left: 14px;
        bottom: 14px;
        width: auto;
        max-width: none;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .cookie-actions {
        width: 100%;
        justify-content: flex-end;
      }

      .modal-window, .compliance-modal-window {
        width: calc(100vw - 20px) !important;
        max-width: 100% !important;
        margin: 10px auto !important;
        padding: 20px 16px !important;
      }

      .search-trigger .search-placeholder {
        font-size: var(--text-xs);
      }
    }

    /* Ultra-Compact Breakpoint Tested Down to 360px (Checklist A9) */
    @media (max-width: 360px) {
      body {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .login-card {
        padding: 20px 12px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      }

      .brand-crest {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .brand-title {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
      }

      .login-heading {
        font-size: 1.45rem;
      }

      .login-description {
        font-size: 12.5px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .demo-role-pills {
        gap: 4px;
      }

      .demo-role-btn {
        padding: 6px 9px;
        font-size: 10.5px;
      }

      .content-canvas {
        padding: 14px 10px;
      }

      .student-title-row h1, .page-header-title {
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .stat-card-value {
        font-size: 1.65rem;
      }

      .btn-primary, .btn-secondary {
        padding: 9px 12px;
        font-size: 13px;
        min-height: 44px;
      }

      .topbar-right, .header-right {
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .shortcut-keys {
        display: none;
      }
    }

    /* Reduced Motion Accessibility */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      }
    }
  

/* =========================================================================
       10. STUDENT OS MODULES SPECIFIC STYLES
       Visual consistency strictly maintained with Foundation Design Tokens:
       --color-blue: #6A8EAE, --color-beige: #D4C9B7, --color-cream: #F8F4ED, --color-sage: #9EBBAF
       ========================================================================= */
    .student-page-header {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .student-eyebrow {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-blue);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .student-eyebrow svg {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
    }

    .student-title-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .student-title-row h1 {
      font-size: var(--text-3xl);
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .student-title-row p {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* Four Stat Cards Grid with Distinct Elevation Hierarchy */
    .student-stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 24px 22px 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 18px -2px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.05), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.02);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: transform var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring),
                  box-shadow var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring),
                  border-color var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }

    /* Soft top radiant gradient accent instead of flat stripe */
    .stat-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-blue) 0%, rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.35) 60%, rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.5) 100%);
      opacity: 0.85;
      transition: height 180ms ease, opacity 180ms ease;
    }

    /* Atmospheric soft top glow on card */
    .stat-card::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 15%;
      right: 15%;
      height: 30px;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.18), transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.75;
      transition: opacity 180ms ease;
    }

    .stat-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px -4px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.08), 0 4px 12px -2px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.06);
      border-color: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.28);
    }
    .stat-card:hover::before {
      height: 3.5px;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    .stat-card:hover::after {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    /* Uppercase tracked-out category eyebrows */
    .stat-card-label {
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    /* Tinted icon badge background behind the icon */
    .stat-card-label i,
    .stat-card-label svg {
      width: 32px !important;
      height: 32px !important;
      padding: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12);
      color: var(--color-blue);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }
    .stat-card:hover .stat-card-label i,
    .stat-card:hover .stat-card-label svg {
      transform: scale(1.08);
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.18);
    }

    /* Noticeably larger/bolder stat value for real visual weight */
    .stat-card-value {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 2.65rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.05;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      margin: 4px 0 10px;
    }

    .stat-card-footer {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    /* Varied subtle elevation & color-matched accents so they don't read as identically weighted */
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(1) {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 22px -2px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.07), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.08);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(1)::before {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-sage) 0%, rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.3) 100%);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(1)::after {
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.24), transparent 70%);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(1) .stat-card-label i,
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(1) .stat-card-label svg {
      background: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.22);
      color: #355d4b;
    }

    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(2) {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px -2px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.05), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.08);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(2)::before {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #B87B2E 0%, rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.45) 100%);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(2)::after {
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.3), transparent 70%);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(2) .stat-card-label i,
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(2) .stat-card-label svg {
      background: rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.32);
      color: #7b5e39;
    }

    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(3) {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px -2px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.04), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.06);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(3)::before {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-blue) 0%, rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.35) 100%);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(3)::after {
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.22), transparent 70%);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(3) .stat-card-label i,
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(3) .stat-card-label svg {
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.16);
      color: var(--color-blue);
    }

    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(4) {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px -2px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.04);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(4)::before {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6c8a77 0%, rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.3) 100%);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(4)::after {
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.18), transparent 70%);
    }
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(4) .stat-card-label i,
    .student-stats-grid .stat-card:nth-child(4) .stat-card-label svg {
      background: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.18);
      color: #3b5f4f;
    }

    /* Bento 2-Col Layout for Dashboard */
    .student-bento-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    /* Section Headers with Visual Presence & Subtle Accent */
    .bento-card-title-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    }

    .bento-card-title-row h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.38rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      line-height: 1.25;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .bento-card-title-row h3::before {
      content: "";
      display: inline-block;
      width: 3.5px;
      height: 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-blue), var(--color-sage));
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .bento-card-title-row .subtext {
      font-size: 0.813rem;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* Timetable period rows in Dashboard & Timetable page */
    .period-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .period-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .period-item:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      border-color: var(--color-border);
    }

    /* Current period live styling with sage border and glow */
    .period-item.live-period {
      background: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.12) !important;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--color-sage) !important;
      box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.32) !important;
      position: relative;
    }

    .period-item.complete-period {
      opacity: 0.72;
    }

    .period-time-col {
      width: 140px;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
    }

    .period-time-col span.period-num {
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    .period-main-col {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }

    .period-subject-name {
      font-size: var(--text-base);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .period-meta-text {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    /* Live Countdown Clock Badge */
    .live-countdown-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #3b5f4f;
      background: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.28);
      border: 1px solid rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.5);
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.3);
    }

    /* Animated Progress Bar */
    .progress-track {
      width: 100%;
      height: 8px;
      background: rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.08);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-blue), var(--color-sage));
      transition: width 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      position: relative;
    }

    .progress-fill.animated-pulse::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45), transparent);
      animation: progressShimmer 2.2s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes progressShimmer {
      0% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
      100% { transform: translateX(100%); }
    }

    /* Live Activity Stream Feed */
    .feed-stream {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .feed-item {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }

    .feed-item:hover {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-color: var(--color-border-warm);
    }

    .feed-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .feed-time {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    .feed-title {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .feed-desc {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       TIMETABLE PAGE HERO & MODES
       ========================================================================= */
    .timetable-hero-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--color-sage);
      box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.25);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 26px 30px;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .countdown-display-large {
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 2.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .countdown-display-large small {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Timetable mode toggle pill bar */
    .timetable-controls-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .mode-pill-group {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      padding: 3px;
    }

    .mode-pill {
      padding: 5px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .mode-pill.active {
      background: var(--color-blue);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.35);
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       ASSIGNMENTS MODULE STYLES
       ========================================================================= */
    .assignments-stats-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .asg-filter-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .asg-filter-pills {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .asg-filter-btn {
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .asg-filter-btn:hover, .asg-filter-btn.active {
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      background: #FFFFFF;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .asg-filter-btn.active {
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.14);
      color: #315372;
    }

    .asg-card {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .asg-card:hover {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-color: var(--color-border-warm);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .asg-card.completed {
      background: rgba(248, 244, 237, 0.6);
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .asg-card.completed .asg-title {
      text-decoration: line-through;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    .asg-checkbox-box {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      border: 2px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .asg-card.completed .asg-checkbox-box {
      background: var(--color-sage);
      border-color: var(--color-sage);
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .asg-card.completed .asg-checkbox-box svg {
      stroke: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .asg-meta-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 4px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       DIGITAL PASS: SIGNATURE 3D FLIP CARD
       ========================================================================= */
    .pass-layout {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .pass-container {
      perspective: 1400px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .pass-card-3d {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: 580px;
      transform-style: preserve-3d;
      -webkit-transform-style: preserve-3d;
      transition: transform 600ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .pass-card-3d.flipped {
      transform: rotateY(180deg);
    }

    .pass-face {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      backface-visibility: hidden;
      -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 34px 30px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
    }

    .pass-face.back {
      transform: rotateY(180deg);
      background: #1C232B;
      color: #F8F4ED;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.35);
    }

    /* Subtle luxury gloss sheen */
    .pass-gloss {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 40%, transparent 58%);
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .pass-back-glow {
      position: absolute;
      width: 280px;
      height: 280px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.2) 0%, transparent 70%);
      top: -70px;
      right: -70px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .pass-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      padding-bottom: 16px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .pass-face.back .pass-header {
      border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .pass-brand-tag {
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
    }

    .pass-face.back .pass-brand-tag {
      color: #A6B4C4;
    }

    .pass-avatar-wrapper {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      margin: 12px 0 16px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .pass-avatar-ring {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-blue), #456682);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 4px solid #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.32);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .pass-student-name {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .pass-student-stream {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .pass-meta-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .pass-meta-item {
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: rgba(248, 244, 237, 0.75);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    }

    .pass-meta-label {
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .pass-meta-val {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .pass-qr-frame {
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 10px auto;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .pass-token-badge {
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      color: var(--color-sage);
      background: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.14);
      border: 1px solid rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.35);
      padding: 7px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      text-align: center;
      margin: 10px 0 6px;
      display: inline-block;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.18);
    }

    .flip-instruction-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .flip-instruction-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       PITCH PAD GRID & CARDS
       ========================================================================= */
    .pitch-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .pitch-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .pitch-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
    }

    .pitch-card.directors-pick-active {
      border-color: var(--color-beige);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.35);
    }

    .directors-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: #725a2a;
      background: rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.42);
      border: 1px solid rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.85);
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      align-self: flex-start;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .pitch-card.directors-pick-active .directors-badge {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .pitch-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .pitch-desc {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .pitch-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .pitch-tag {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      background: rgba(248, 244, 237, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .pitch-action-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      padding-top: 14px;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .vote-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .vote-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      background: #FFFFFF;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .vote-btn.voted {
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.16);
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      color: #2b4f6e;
    }

    .vote-btn.voted svg {
      fill: var(--color-blue);
    }

    .toggle-switch-wrap {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .toggle-switch-label {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .toggle-switch-track {
      width: 38px;
      height: 22px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.16);
      position: relative;
      transition: background var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }

    .toggle-switch-wrap.active .toggle-switch-track {
      background: var(--color-blue);
    }

    .toggle-switch-knob {
      position: absolute;
      top: 3px;
      left: 3px;
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      transition: transform var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .toggle-switch-wrap.active .toggle-switch-knob {
      transform: translateX(16px);
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       CLUBS & HOUSES STYLES
       ========================================================================= */
    .house-hero-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 32px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .house-leaderboard-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .house-mini-card {
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      text-align: center;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }

    .house-mini-card.is-current {
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12);
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.15);
    }

    .clubs-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .club-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .club-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
      border-color: var(--color-border-warm);
    }

    /* Responsive media query tweaks */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .student-stats-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
      .student-bento-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .pitch-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
      .house-leaderboard-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .student-stats-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .pitch-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .house-leaderboard-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .pass-card-3d {
        height: 550px;
      }
      .pass-face {
        padding: 24px 20px;
      }
      .assignments-stats-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  

/* =========================================================================
       7. TEACHER MODULE SPECIFIC STYLES (MATCHING SHELL EXACTLY)
       ========================================================================= */
    /* Stat Cards Row (Teacher Module) */
    .stat-grid-4 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .stat-grid-4 .stat-card-meta {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
    }

    /* Live Classes Section */
    .live-classes-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .live-class-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
      position: relative;
    }

    .live-class-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .live-class-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .live-class-sub {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .live-class-attendance-wrap {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    /* SVG Circular Attendance Ring */
    .ring-container {
      position: relative;
      width: 58px;
      height: 58px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .ring-svg {
      transform: rotate(-90deg);
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .ring-bg {
      fill: none;
      stroke: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.16);
      stroke-width: 5;
    }

    .ring-progress {
      fill: none;
      stroke: var(--color-sage);
      stroke-width: 5;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.8s var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .ring-percentage {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .attendance-bar-wrap {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .attendance-bar-label {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .attendance-bar-track {
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.14);
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .attendance-bar-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-sage), #80a797);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      transition: width 0.8s var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .live-class-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    /* Attendance Toolbar */
    .attendance-toolbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .attendance-summary-pills {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .summary-counter-pill {
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    }

    /* Gradebook Inline Input */
    .grade-score-input {
      width: 60px;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .grade-score-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      background: #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.18);
    }

    .grade-score-input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
    .grade-score-input::-webkit-inner-spin-button {
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .grade-score-input[type=number] {
      -moz-appearance: textfield;
    }

    /* Class Assignments Cards Grid */
    .assignments-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(360px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .assignment-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      transition: all var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .assignment-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
    }

    .assignment-tags {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .assignment-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .assignment-meta-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .assignment-progress-section {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 12px 14px;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .assignment-progress-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .assignment-progress-track {
      height: 7px;
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.15);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .assignment-progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-blue), var(--color-sage));
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      transition: width 1s var(--ease-spring);
    }

    /* Broadcasts Layout */
    .broadcasts-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr;
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .composer-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 26px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
    }

    .composer-input, .composer-textarea, .composer-select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .composer-input:focus, .composer-textarea:focus, .composer-select:focus {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.16);
    }

    .composer-textarea {
      resize: vertical;
      min-height: 120px;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    .announcements-feed {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .announcement-item {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 20px 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
      transition: all var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
      position: relative;
    }

    .announcement-item.newly-added {
      animation: announcementSlideIn 400ms var(--ease-spring);
    }

    @keyframes announcementSlideIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-12px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .announcement-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .announcement-headline {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .announcement-meta {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .announcement-body {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* Modal for New Assignment */
    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.5);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      z-index: 110;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-smooth);
    }

    .modal-overlay.active {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .modal-dialog {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 32px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
      transform: scale(0.96) translateY(-8px);
      transition: transform var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .modal-overlay.active .modal-dialog {
      transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
    }

    .modal-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .modal-close-btn {
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      padding: 6px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      transition: color var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }

    .modal-close-btn:hover {
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }



    

/* =========================================================================
       7. STAT CARDS & METRICS
       ========================================================================= */
    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .stat-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.688rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    }

    .stat-icon {
      width: 32px !important;
      height: 32px !important;
      padding: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--color-blue);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }
    .stat-card:hover .stat-icon {
      transform: scale(1.08);
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.18);
    }

    .stat-value {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 2.65rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin: 4px 0 10px;
    }

    .stat-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .stat-meta .meta-pill {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #3f607c;
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12);
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       8. PROGRESS BARS & DEPARTMENT PERFORMANCE
       ========================================================================= */
    .progress-section {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .progress-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .dept-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 7px;
    }

    .dept-meta-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
    }

    .dept-name {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .dept-details {
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .dept-score {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .progress-track {
      width: 100%;
      height: 9px;
      background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .dept-progress-bar {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-blue), var(--color-sage));
      width: 0%;
      transition: width 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       9. EMERGENCY CONTROL PANEL (RESTRICTED CALM WARNING STYLING)
       ========================================================================= */
    .emergency-station {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 34px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .emergency-station::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #BA6868, #D4C9B7, #6A8EAE);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl) var(--radius-xl) 0 0;
    }

    .emergency-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      background: rgba(186, 104, 104, 0.12);
      color: #9c4545;
      border: 1px solid rgba(186, 104, 104, 0.3);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .emergency-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .emergency-action-card {
      background: rgba(248, 244, 237, 0.6);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .emergency-action-card.siren-danger {
      border-color: rgba(186, 104, 104, 0.4);
      background: rgba(255, 250, 250, 0.85);
    }

    .emergency-active-banner {
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: rgba(186, 104, 104, 0.14);
      border: 1px solid rgba(186, 104, 104, 0.35);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      animation: alertPulse 2s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    .emergency-active-banner.active {
      display: flex;
    }

    @keyframes alertPulse {
      0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(186, 104, 104, 0.2); }
      70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(186, 104, 104, 0); }
      100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(186, 104, 104, 0); }
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       10. FEED STYLES
       ========================================================================= */
    .feed-filter-bar {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .filter-btn {
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }

    .filter-btn:hover {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .filter-btn.active {
      background: var(--color-blue);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border-color: var(--color-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.3);
    }

    .feed-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .feed-item-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 20px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .feed-item-card:hover {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .feed-cat-icon {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .feed-cat-icon.operations { background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.14); color: #3f607c; }
    .feed-cat-icon.academics { background: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.22); color: #395c4d; }
    .feed-cat-icon.student-life { background: rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.35); color: #645846; }
    .feed-cat-icon.it { background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.2); color: #2e4b65; }

    .feed-content {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .feed-header-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .feed-title {
      font-size: var(--text-md);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      line-height: 1.35;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .feed-subtext {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       11. MODALS & DIALOGS
       ========================================================================= */
    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.5);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      z-index: 150;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-smooth);
    }

    .modal-overlay.active {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .modal-window {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 540px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 32px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
      transform: scale(0.96) translateY(8px);
      transition: transform var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .modal-overlay.active .modal-window {
      transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
    }

    .modal-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .modal-close-btn {
      padding: 6px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
      transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
    }

    .modal-close-btn:hover {
      color: var(--color-ink);
      background: rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.06);
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       12. TOAST NOTIFICATION
       ========================================================================= */
    .system-toast {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 24px;
      right: 24px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 14px 18px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
      z-index: 200;
      transform: translateY(20px);
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: all var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
    }

    .system-toast.show {
      transform: translateY(0);
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .toast-icon {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      color: var(--color-sage);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Highlight pulse for new audit entries */
    @keyframes newRowHighlight {
      0% { background: rgba(158, 187, 175, 0.35); }
      100% { background: transparent; }
    }

    .row-highlight-new {
      animation: newRowHighlight 2.4s ease-out;
    }

    


/* =========================================================================
   DEDUPLICATED & UNIFIED SHARED COMPONENT STYLES
   ========================================================================= */
/* Unified Modals & Dialogs */
.modal-overlay {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.55);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  z-index: 150;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 20px;
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-smooth);
}
.modal-overlay.active {
  opacity: 1;
  pointer-events: auto;
}
.modal-dialog, .modal-window {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 540px;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 32px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
  transform: scale(0.96) translateY(0);
  transition: transform var(--duration-quick) var(--ease-spring);
  max-height: 90vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
}
.modal-overlay.active .modal-dialog,
.modal-overlay.active .modal-window {
  transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
}
.modal-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-start;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.modal-close-btn {
  color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
  padding: 6px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
}
.modal-close-btn:hover {
  color: var(--color-ink);
  background: rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.06);
}

/* Unified Toast Notifications (Glass-Card Language) */
.toast-notification, .system-toast, #app-toast {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 24px;
  right: 28px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  color: var(--color-ink);
  padding: 14px 20px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 40px -8px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.15), 0 0 0 1px rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.18);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  z-index: 1000;
  transform: translateY(40px);
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: all var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-spring);
  max-width: 420px;
}
.toast-notification.active, .system-toast.active, #app-toast.active,
.toast-notification.show, .system-toast.show, #app-toast.show {
  transform: translateY(0);
  opacity: 1;
  pointer-events: auto;
}
#toast-icon-wrap {
  width: 32px !important;
  height: 32px !important;
  border-radius: 50% !important;
  background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12) !important;
  color: var(--color-blue) !important;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
#toast-title {
  color: var(--color-ink) !important;
}
#toast-message {
  color: var(--color-ink-muted) !important;
}

/* Quick Demo Role Selector Pills on Login Screen */
.demo-role-pills {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 16px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.demo-role-btn {
  background: rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(106, 142, 174, 0.28);
  border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  padding: 5px 12px;
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-ink);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all var(--duration-quick) ease;
}
.demo-role-btn:hover {
  background: var(--color-blue);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  border-color: var(--color-blue);
}

/* Dedicated Deadline Card & Micro-accents */
.deadline-card {
  background: linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94) 0%, rgba(250, 247, 242, 0.9) 100%) !important;
  border: 1px solid rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.65) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 24px -2px rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.28), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(28, 35, 43, 0.03) !important;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.deadline-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 3px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #B87B2E 0%, rgba(212, 201, 183, 0.6) 100%);
}

  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Atmospheric Ambient Background Depth (Checklist Visual Hierarchy) -->
  <div class="ambient-orbs" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ambient-orb-blue"></div>
    <div class="ambient-orb-sage"></div>
    <div class="ambient-orb-warm"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- =======================================================================
       1. LOGIN EXPERIENCE & LIVE ROLE DETECTOR
       ======================================================================= -->
<section class="login-viewport" id="login-viewport" role="region" aria-label="Institutional Authentication">
<div class="login-card">
<div class="brand-mark">
<div class="brand-crest" aria-hidden="true">B</div>
<div>
<div class="brand-title">BrainzOS</div>
<div class="brand-tagline">Institutional Operating System</div>
</div>
</div>
<h1 class="login-heading">Welcome back.</h1>
<p class="login-description">
        Access your academic and administrative workspace. Select a demo identity below or enter your institutional credentials.
      </p>

<!-- Above-the-Fold Quick Launch Persona Selector (Checklist A2) -->
<div class="demo-role-pills" style="margin-bottom: 20px;" role="group" aria-label="Quick Demo Personas">
  <button class="demo-role-btn" onclick="quickSelectRole('student')" type="button" aria-label="Quick sign-in as Student Ishaan Kalra">
    <span class="role-dot" style="background: var(--color-blue); display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 4px;" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    Student (Ishaan)
  </button>
  <button class="demo-role-btn" onclick="quickSelectRole('teacher')" type="button" aria-label="Quick sign-in as Teacher Aarav Mehta">
    <span class="role-dot" style="background: var(--color-sage); display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 4px;" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    Teacher (Aarav)
  </button>
  <button class="demo-role-btn" onclick="quickSelectRole('director')" type="button" aria-label="Quick sign-in as Director Dr. Rhea Sharma">
    <span class="role-dot" style="background: #A08264; display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 4px;" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    Director (Dr. Rhea)
  </button>
</div>

<form id="login-form" novalidate onsubmit="handleLoginSubmit(event)">
<div class="form-group">
<label class="form-label" for="school-email">What's your school email?</label>
<div class="input-wrapper">
<span class="input-icon">
<i data-lucide="mail" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</span>
<input autocomplete="email" id="school-email" placeholder="e.g., student@brainz.edu" required="" type="email" aria-describedby="login-email-error" oninput="clearLoginError()"/>
</div>
<!-- Inline Form Error Display (Checklist A12 & B9) -->
<div class="form-field-error" id="login-email-error" style="display: none;" role="alert">
  <i data-lucide="alert-circle" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
  <span id="login-email-error-text">Please enter a valid @brainz.edu email address.</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Live Role Detection Animated Banner -->
<div class="role-detection-box" id="role-detector-box">
<span class="detection-label">Role Detected</span>
<span class="detection-result" id="role-detector-text">
<span class="role-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<span>Awaiting school email…</span>
</span>
</div>

<!-- Sticky Mobile Action Wrapper (Checklist A10) -->
<div class="login-sticky-cta">
  <button class="btn-primary" disabled="" id="continue-btn" type="submit" aria-label="Continue to BrainzOS workspace">
    <span>Continue to BrainzOS</span>
    <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width: 17px; height: 17px;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
  </button>
</div>

<button class="btn-secondary" id="biometric-btn" onclick="startBiometricLogin()" type="button" style="margin-top: 10px;" aria-label="Sign in with biometric authentication">
<i data-lucide="fingerprint" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
<span>Sign in with biometrics</span>
</button>
</form>

<div class="auth-footer">
        Protected institutional gateway · CBSE Senior Secondary Curriculum<br/>
        Brainz Academic Computing Cluster ·
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="openComplianceModal('privacy')" class="footer-link" title="View Institutional Data Privacy Policy">Privacy Policy</a> ·
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="openComplianceModal('terms')" class="footer-link" title="View Terms of Institutional Use">Terms of Use</a> ·
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="openSupportModal()" class="footer-link" title="Campus IT Helpdesk & Support">IT Helpdesk</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

  <!-- =======================================================================
       2. APP SHELL CONTAINER (SIDEBAR, HEADER, CONTENT CANVAS)
       ======================================================================= -->
  <div id="app-viewport" class="app-viewport">
    <!-- Collapsible Responsive Sidebar -->
    <aside id="app-sidebar" class="app-sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-brand">
        <div class="brand-crest">B</div>
        <div class="sidebar-brand-text">
          <h2>BrainzOS</h2>
          <span>Senior Secondary</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation dynamically populated based on logged-in role -->
      <nav id="sidebar-nav-container" class="sidebar-nav-items"></nav>

      <!-- Sidebar Footer / Identity Card -->
      <div class="sidebar-footer">
        <div class="user-card-sm">
          <div class="user-avatar" id="sidebar-user-avatar">--</div>
          <div class="user-meta">
            <h4 id="sidebar-user-name">Not Signed In</h4>
            <span class="user-role-badge" id="sidebar-user-badge">Guest</span>
          </div>
          <button class="icon-btn-subtle" onclick="logoutUser()" title="Sign Out / Lock Session">
            <i data-lucide="log-out" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 17px; height: 17px;"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <!-- Main Workspace Container -->
    <div class="workspace-area">
      <!-- Topbar with Search & Identity -->
      <header class="app-header">
        <div class="header-left">
          <button class="mobile-toggle-btn" onclick="toggleMobileSidebar()" title="Toggle Navigation">
            <i data-lucide="menu" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 20px; height: 20px;"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="search-trigger" onclick="openCommandLauncher()" title="Press Cmd+K or Ctrl+K">
            <i data-lucide="search" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
            <span class="search-placeholder">Find pages, coursework, commands…</span>
            <div class="shortcut-keys">
              <span class="kbd">⌘</span>
              <span class="kbd">K</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="header-right">
          <div class="connection-status">
            <span class="status-indicator"></span>
            <span>CBSE Cluster Online</span>
          </div>

          <div class="user-profile-menu">
            <div class="user-avatar-top" id="topbar-user-avatar">--</div>
            <div class="user-profile-info">
              <span class="topbar-name" id="topbar-user-name">User</span>
              <span class="topbar-subtext" id="topbar-user-role">Role</span>
            </div>
            <button class="header-logout-btn" onclick="logoutUser()" title="Sign Out">
              <i data-lucide="log-out" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Content Canvas: hosts active pages from all three roles -->
      <main id="content-canvas" class="content-canvas" role="main">
        <!-- Async Route Transition & Data Sync Skeleton (Checklist A11) -->
        <div id="async-route-loader" class="async-route-loader" aria-hidden="true" role="status">
          <div class="loader-content">
            <div class="academic-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="loader-text">
              <span class="loader-title">Academic Registry Sync</span>
              <span class="loader-subtitle" id="loader-status-text">Fetching latest cohort records from CBSE node…</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Custom In-App 404 / Unknown Route View (Checklist A1) -->
        <section class="os-page" id="page-404" role="region" aria-label="Route Not Found">
          <div class="notfound-card">
            <div class="notfound-icon-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
              <i data-lucide="compass" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: var(--text-xs); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--color-status-amber); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">
              Status 404 · Unresolved Academic Route
            </div>
            <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: var(--text-3xl); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 14px;">
              Module Not Found in Directory
            </h2>
            <p style="color: var(--color-ink-muted); font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px;">
              The requested institutional route <code id="notfound-route-slug" style="background: var(--color-surface-cream); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);">/unknown</code> does not exist or requires elevated clearance.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <button class="btn-primary" onclick="returnToRoleDashboard()" style="width: auto; padding: 12px 24px;" aria-label="Return to your authorized role dashboard">
                <i data-lucide="layout-dashboard" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span>Return to Authorized Dashboard</span>
              </button>
              <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="openCommandLauncher()" style="width: auto; padding: 12px 20px;" aria-label="Search Modules with Command Launcher">
                <i data-lucide="search" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span>Search Modules (⌘K)</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Foundation Welcome & Fallback State -->
        <section class="os-page active" id="os-shell-welcome" role="region" aria-label="Welcome Overview">
          <div class="placeholder-container">
            <div class="placeholder-badge">
              <span class="badge badge-blue">Foundation Workspace Initialized</span>
            </div>
            <h2 id="welcome-heading" style="margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: var(--text-3xl);">Welcome to BrainzOS</h2>
            <p id="welcome-subtext" style="max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 24px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-ink-muted);">
              Unified institutional operating system for Senior Secondary education. Select an operational role or navigate via the command launcher.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <button class="btn-primary" onclick="returnToRoleDashboard()" style="width: auto; padding: 10px 20px;" aria-label="Enter Active Dashboard">
                <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span>Enter Role Dashboard</span>
              </button>
              <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="openCommandLauncher()" style="width: auto; padding: 10px 18px;" aria-label="Open Command Palette">
                <i data-lucide="terminal" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span>Open Command Palette (⌘K)</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

<section class="os-page" id="page-student-dashboard">
<!-- Page Header -->
<div class="student-page-header">
<div class="student-eyebrow">
<i data-lucide="graduation-cap" aria-hidden="true"></i>
<span>Academic Year 2026–27 · Term 1</span>
</div>
<div class="student-title-row">
<div>
<h1>Welcome, Ishaan Kalra</h1>
<p>Class XI-B · Stream Commerce · Orion House · ID: BOS-XIB-041</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
<button class="btn-secondary" onclick="navigateTo('page-student-pass')" style="width: auto; padding: 10px 18px;">
<i data-lucide="credit-card" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
<span>Digital Pass</span>
</button>
<button class="btn-primary" onclick="navigateTo('page-student-timetable')" style="width: auto; padding: 10px 20px;">
<i data-lucide="calendar" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
<span>Today's Timetable</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Four Stat Cards -->
<div class="student-stats-grid">
<!-- Card 1: Attendance -->
<div class="stat-card">
<div class="stat-card-label">
<span>Attendance</span>
<i data-lucide="check-circle-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</div>
<div class="stat-card-value">94.6%</div>
<div class="stat-card-footer">
<span class="badge badge-sage" style="font-size: 0.688rem; padding: 2px 7px;">+0.4% this mo</span>
<span>142 / 150 sessions</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 2: Assignments (Live Count) -->
<div class="stat-card" onclick="navigateTo('page-student-assignments')" style="cursor: pointer;">
<div class="stat-card-label">
<span>Assignments</span>
<i data-lucide="file-text" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</div>
<div class="stat-card-value" id="dash-assignments-count">08</div>
<div class="stat-card-footer">
<span class="badge badge-beige" style="font-size: 0.688rem; padding: 2px 7px;">2 Due Soon</span>
<span id="dash-assignments-sub">Active tasks pending</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 3: House Points -->
<div class="stat-card" onclick="navigateTo('page-student-clubs')" style="cursor: pointer;">
<div class="stat-card-label">
<span>House Points</span>
<i data-lucide="shield" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</div>
<div class="stat-card-value">1,240</div>
<div class="stat-card-footer">
<span class="badge badge-blue" style="font-size: 0.688rem; padding: 2px 7px;">Rank #2</span>
<span>Orion House (140 pts to #1)</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 4: Pitch Pad Rank -->
<div class="stat-card" onclick="navigateTo('page-student-pitch')" style="cursor: pointer;">
<div class="stat-card-label">
<span>Pitch Pad Rank</span>
<i data-lucide="rocket" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</div>
<div class="stat-card-value">#04</div>
<div class="stat-card-footer">
<span class="badge badge-sage" style="font-size: 0.688rem; padding: 2px 7px;">Top 5 Finalist</span>
<span>QueueLess · 42 votes</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Bento Grid: Timetable + Deadline & Live School Feed -->
<div class="student-bento-grid">
<!-- Left: Today's Timetable List -->
<div class="card">
<div class="bento-card-title-row">
<div>
<h3>Today's Timetable</h3>
<div class="subtext" style="margin-top: 3px;">Periods compute status live from the clock</div>
</div>
<button class="badge badge-blue" onclick="navigateTo('page-student-timetable')" style="cursor: pointer;">
<span>Full Timeline</span>
<i data-lucide="arrow-right" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 12px; height: 12px;"></i>
</button>
</div>
<div class="period-list" id="dashboard-period-list">
<!-- Dynamically populated by updateTimetableState() -->
</div>
</div>
<!-- Right: Next Deadline + Live School Feed -->
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
<!-- Next Deadline Card -->
<div class="card deadline-card">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px;">
<span class="badge badge-beige">Next Deadline</span>
<span class="subtext" style="font-weight: 600;">Tomorrow · 9:00 AM</span>
</div>
<h4 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">
                  Market Structure Case
                </h4>
<p style="font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--color-ink-muted); margin-bottom: 16px;">
                  Business Studies · Unit 4: Monopoly &amp; Oligopoly Price Rigidity Case Study.
                </p>
<!-- Real Animated Progress Bar -->
<div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: var(--text-xs); margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 600;">
<span style="color: var(--color-ink-muted);">Window Elapsed</span>
<span id="dash-deadline-timer" style="color: var(--color-blue);">14h 28m remaining</span>
</div>
<div class="progress-track" style="height: 9px;">
<div class="progress-fill animated-pulse" style="width: 76%;"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);">
<span class="subtext" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">Weightage: 15% · PDF Deliverable</span>
<button class="btn-primary" onclick="navigateTo('page-student-assignments')" style="width: auto; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: var(--text-xs);">
<span>View Task</span>
<i data-lucide="chevron-right" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"></i>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Live School Feed Activity Stream -->
<div class="card">
<div class="bento-card-title-row">
<div>
<h3>Live School Feed</h3>
<div class="subtext" style="margin-top: 2px;">Campus bulletin &amp; society dispatches</div>
</div>
<span class="badge badge-sage">
<span class="status-dot"></span>
<span>Live</span>
</span>
</div>
<div class="feed-stream">
<!-- Feed Item 1: Commerce Club -->
<div class="feed-item">
<div class="feed-top">
<span class="badge badge-blue" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">Commerce Club</span>
<span class="feed-time">Today · 08:45 AM</span>
</div>
<div class="feed-title">Mock-Trading Challenge Registrations</div>
<div class="feed-desc">
                      Intra-school mock equity trading portal opens at 2:00 PM today. Virtual portfolios are now seeded with ₹1,00,000 demo capital.
                    </div>
</div>
<!-- Feed Item 2: Student Council -->
<div class="feed-item">
<div class="feed-top">
<span class="badge badge-beige" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">Student Council</span>
<span class="feed-time">Yesterday · 4:15 PM</span>
</div>
<div class="feed-title">House Cup Standings Revised</div>
<div class="feed-desc">
                      Orion House earns +120 points following the Inter-House Business Quiz win, cutting Phoenix's lead to 140 points.
                    </div>
</div>
<!-- Feed Item 3: BrainzOS Pass -->
<div class="feed-item">
<div class="feed-top">
<span class="badge badge-sage" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">BrainzOS Identity</span>
<span class="feed-time">Yesterday · 11:30 AM</span>
</div>
<div class="feed-title">NFC Digital Pass Re-Key Refresh</div>
<div class="feed-desc">
                      NFC smart turnstiles across Central Quad and Library gates updated with dynamic rotating cryptographic tokens.
                    </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="os-page" id="page-student-timetable">
<div class="student-page-header">
<div class="student-eyebrow">
<i data-lucide="clock" aria-hidden="true"></i>
<span>Academic Timetable · Spring Term 2026–27</span>
</div>
<div class="student-title-row">
<div>
<h1>Class XI-B Timetable</h1>
<p>Stream Commerce · 6 Daily Periods · Automatic Real-Time Period Detection</p>
</div>
<div class="system-status-pill">
<span class="status-beacon">
<span class="status-pulse"></span>
<span class="status-dot"></span>
</span>
<span id="timetable-real-clock">00:00:00</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Controls Bar: Real Clock vs Simulation Mode Toggle -->
<div class="timetable-controls-bar">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
<span class="subtext" style="font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.688rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">Detection Mode:</span>
<div class="mode-pill-group">
<div class="mode-pill active" id="mode-pill-live" onclick="setTimetableMode('live')">
                  Real Current Time
                </div>
<div class="mode-pill" id="mode-pill-sim" onclick="setTimetableMode('sim')">
                  Simulate School Day (Period 3 Live)
                </div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="subtext" id="timetable-mode-hint" style="font-size: var(--text-xs);">
              Evaluating current system clock against period start &amp; end intervals.
            </div>
</div>
<!-- Hero Highlight Card: Current Live Period & Working Countdown Timer -->
<div class="timetable-hero-card" id="timetable-hero-card">
<div>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
<span class="badge badge-sage" id="hero-period-badge">
<span class="status-dot"></span>
<span id="hero-period-status-text">LIVE NOW</span>
</span>
<span class="subtext" id="hero-period-time">10:20 AM – 11:10 AM</span>
</div>
<h2 id="hero-period-name" style="font-size: 2.1rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">Accountancy</h2>
<p id="hero-period-meta" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-ink-muted);">
                Room 112 · Mrs. Sunita Sharma · Ledger Balancing &amp; Journal Entries
              </p>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<div class="subtext" style="font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.688rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--color-ink-subtle);">
                Time Remaining in Period
              </div>
<div class="countdown-display-large">
<span id="hero-countdown-timer">24:18</span>
<small>MM:SS</small>
</div>
<div class="progress-track" style="width: 180px; height: 6px; margin-top: 10px; margin-left: auto;">
<div class="progress-fill" id="hero-countdown-progress" style="width: 52%;"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Full Day Schedule Table / Timeline -->
<div class="card">
<div class="bento-card-title-row">
<h3>Full-Day Schedule Breakdown</h3>
<span class="subtext">Status calculated dynamically without hardcoding</span>
</div>
<div class="period-list" id="timetable-full-list">
<!-- Rendered dynamically by updateTimetableState() -->
</div>
</div>
</section>

