<span class="score-badge score-band-mid">● 70% – 84.9% Proficient (B Tier)</span>
<span class="score-badge score-band-low">● Below 70% Academic Review</span>
<span style="margin-left: auto;">Formula: (Quiz + Case Study + Presentation) / 100</span>
</div>
